    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0962" n="892" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg892"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Partridge.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 8.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 18, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    very interesting despatch of the 26th August last, No. 11, with its several
                    accompaniments.</p>
                <p>The objections urged by the government of Honduras in regard to the colonization
                    of persons of African extraction in that republic are regarded as conclusive by
                    this government.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James R. Partridge,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c. Honduras.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
